                              "type" : "TRANSLATION_LITERAL",
                              "value" : {
                                "code" : null,
                                "message" : "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Learn about error type</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Missing matching attributes</strong><br />Missing minimum set of values for criterion attributes for an identification rule. In the payload, add minimum set of values for criterion attributes for CI Identifier for table<br /><br /></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Required attribute is empty</strong><br />A required attribute is missing in the payload. In the payload, add input value for mandatory field in table<br /><br /></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Missing dependency</strong><br />No relations defined for the dependent class that matches any of its metadata rules. In payload add appropriate relations for dependent class that matches any containment/hosting rules<br /><br /></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Insert not allowed for source</strong><br />An IRE data source rule is configured to prevent data source from inserting CIs of the class. Delete or update the appropriate IRE data source rule to let data source insert CIs of the class<br /><br /></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Identification rule missing</strong><br />Identification rule is missing for a class. Ensure that there is an identification rule for table, and that the rule is active<br /><br /><a href=\"/api/now/v1/context_doc_url/cmdb-ire-landing-page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a></li>\n</ul>",
